.TH "TODOPRO GITHUB PUSH" "1" "2026-10-13" "1.0.0" "todopro github push Manual"
.SH NAME
todopro\-github\-push \- Push TodoPro items to a linked GitHub...
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B todopro github push
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Push TodoPro items to a linked GitHub Project (Pro).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-link\fP TEXT
Link id to push to  [required]
.TP
\fB\-\-create\-missing\-fields\fP
Auto-create the GitHub Project 'Priority' and 'Due Date' fields when they are absent before pushing.
